            4,
            2
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "打发好的蛋黄，导入芝士内，混合均匀。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477010466_46ks7l.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477012562_5ikzd8.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "奶油打发：淡奶油加入糖粉，搅拌到蛋糕抹面的程度。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477014634_opbupg.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477016742_2biel0.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477018743_i50odw.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            6,
            5
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "把打发的奶油加入之前的芝士糊内，轻轻的搅拌。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477020851_31pb6a.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477023568_d3nqlf.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "组装蛋糕：把手指饼干蘸一下咖啡液，一层饼干，一层芝士，面上撒一层糖粉，然后再撒可可粉，可可粉可以等到吃的时候再撒。",
